return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-08T13:09:49+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Sabuntawar oda ta SMS da WhatsApp don shagon ku, wanda aka aiko ta Zinn® Campaigns a ƙarƙashin sunan shagon ku. Haɗa tare da dannawa ɗaya; babu maɓallan da za a liƙa.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Sabuntawar oda','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Shagon ku yana haɗe da Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'An cire haɗin kantin ku. Ba za a aika saƙonni ba.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Wannan haɗin ya ɗauki lokaci mai tsawo ko kuma an fara shi a wani burauzar daban. Latsa Haɗa kuma.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® bai karɓi haɗin ba. Latsa "Haɗa" kuma; idan ya ci gaba da faduwa, tuntuɓi tallafin Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Shafinku ya kasa samun damar shiga Zinn®. Ku duba ko mai masaukin bakinku yana ba da damar haɗin waje, sannan ku danna «Sake haɗawa».','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Aika wa abokan cinikinka sabuntawa ta SMS da WhatsApp game da ododinsu, a ƙarƙashin sunan shagonka, wanda aka biya daga kiredit ɗinka na Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Haɗa yana buɗe Zinn® a wannan taga. Shiga ko ƙirƙiri asusu, amince da wannan shago, kuma za ku dawo nan kai tsaye. Ba za ku taɓa liƙa mabuɗi ba.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Haɗa zuwa Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'An haɗa, amma ba a iya samun Zinn® ba a yanzu. Za mu sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba.','Store'=>'Kanti','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'A buɗe don asusunka','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Ba a buɗe wa asusunka ba tukuna. Zinn® zai aiko maka da imel idan an buɗe.','Disconnect'=>'Cire haɗi','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan shagon ba.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin cire haɗin wannan kantin ba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Littattafan jagora na mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® na WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanai ta yau da kullum, canja wurin shafi kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da kafaffun shafukan yanar gizo, yankuna da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da ajiye kuɗin lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da suka maida wannan sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta duniya ta \'yan kasuwa masu zaman kansu: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko kuma sanya aiki don su yi tayi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawar ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya isa ga dandamalin Zinn®, sannan a sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta kasa cin jarrabawar inganci kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];